t-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          味：樱桃，百香果，深色花香，酒心巧克力\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          Cherry, Passionfruit, Dark flower, Liqueur chocolate\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          这款科克和去年的批次-青柑普洱的风味展现有所不同，冲煮时就能闻到明显的深色花香，一入口能感受到樱桃，百香果，酸质偏高但有层次，中后段出现的酵感偏向酒心巧克力，质感细腻~\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SMwshHvmLuFt95wOa4ykO2biaEQwLeobWZz5njtWWJ7tzuwicwjzvedd5bQgXlkbELLjlnukk5AOKA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TLQvzsbN9k3qsnfbqq9YkkibLQ4NED3vmNibKZS2ol4HcCq7mxEUR0egkhhq7uZIn6vficObjd3iaribA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于Koke\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          Koke 位于耶加雪菲小镇的Koke村，处理站位于海拔1973米，处理站服务周边近2000户小农；去年我们拿到的批次是超级日晒，由世界咖啡师冠军，来自澳洲ONA咖啡的Sasa领军的Project Origin生豆项目在埃塞、肯尼亚开拓的一种“有氧+厌氧”结合的一种发酵方式，从查到的资料里推测应该是咖啡鲜果采收后，在一个并非完全封闭的环境，允许以定量的氧气通量，同时遮光的条件下进行静置发酵。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#333333;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;\">\n           今年的这个批次是120小时的厌氧日晒，鲜果采收后手选掉一些瑕疵果，然后将咖啡果密封在发酵罐厌氧120小时，然后拿出来到晒床晾晒；晾晒期间的晚上果子会被盖起来防止返潮，然后干燥结束后静置几周后运输到首都阿迪斯阿巴巴的脱壳厂等待脱壳装袋。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SzAPZmDToyWicYBiatibfYicnYatNbutqaN4AFtAoR245wwkzRuZ1ibB2wvdibxwA55rKfajib7oNMN3tXg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-